From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] main: capture Sugar shortcuts on the Home surface

GTK4 focus can remain inside a Home child (the search entry, activity icon,
or a view-specific widget).  The top-level window controller is not a reliable
owner for those native child surfaces, so register the same semantic handler
on HomeWindow as well.  This keeps F1--F6 and semantic shortcuts available
without changing the action table or importing GTK3 into the process.

---
 src/jarabe/main.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/jarabe/main.py b/src/jarabe/main.py
--- a/src/jarabe/main.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/main.py
@@ -171,6 +171,7 @@
     semantic_keys = keyhandler.get_instance()
     if semantic_keys is not None:
         activity_keys = Gtk.EventControllerKey()
         activity_keys.set_propagation_phase(Gtk.PropagationPhase.CAPTURE)
         activity_keys.connect("key-pressed", semantic_keys._key_pressed_cb)
         shell_instance.compositor.add_controller(activity_keys)
         shell_instance._activity_key_controller = activity_keys
+        semantic_keys.add_window(home_window)
     shell_instance.stack.set_visible_child_name("home")
